&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 15px; line-height: 15px; margin-right: 3px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -10px"&gt;
&lt;span style="font-size: 10px"&gt;◇事業所災害対策（洪水他）の更なる推進&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="height: 22.67px"&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 80px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 5px; line-height: 15px; margin-right: 3px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;
&lt;span style="font-size: 10px"&gt;激甚化する自然災害に備える災害対応ソリューションや製品需要の増加&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 68px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000"&gt;
&lt;p style="line-height: 15px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;
&lt;span style="font-size: 10px"&gt;機会&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 60px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000"&gt;
&lt;p style="line-height: 15px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;
&lt;span style="font-size: 10px"&gt;●●&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 160px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 15px; line-height: 15px; margin-right: 3px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -10px"&gt;
&lt;span style="font-size: 10px"&gt;◆自然災害の激甚化（台風大型化等）が懸念され、災害に備える動きが活発化する。&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 15px; line-height: 15px; margin-right: 3px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;
&lt;span style="font-size: 10px"&gt;それに伴い、当社の屋根・壁高強度製品や水密性能の高い製品・施工の需要が拡大する。&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 140px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 15px; line-height: 15px; margin-right: 3px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -10px"&gt;
